ry = entries[i];\n-\t\tconst message = getMessageFromEntry(entry);\n+\t\tconst message = getMessageFromEntry(entry, edits.get(entry.id));\n \t\tif (!message) continue;\n \n \t\t// Extract file ops from assistant messages (tool calls)",
